Subject: [PATCH] feat(dpi): Decision Performance Index MVP v1.0

- dpi.html: flagship constraint-led assessment (6 dimensions x 3 Likert
  statements, 1-5 scale), progress indicator, save-on-submit, executive
  report (score, band, primary/secondary constraint, dimension breakdown,
  recommended focus area + next step), printable, mobile + desktop.
- api/dpi-submit.js: optional anonymous, benchmark-ready storage endpoint
  (best-effort, fails silently; no personal data).
- migration_build4.sql: dpi_results table (RLS locked, server-write only,
  band/constraint/score CHECK constraints, benchmark cohort index).
- index.html: DPI added as flagship featured instrument.
- docs/builds/dpi-mvp-build-notes.md: architecture, data model, scoring,
  benchmark hooks, open issues.

Scoring per methodology: dim score=((raw-3)/12)*100; overall=mean of six;
bands 0-39/40-59/60-79/80-100; primary=lowest dimension. Verified 19/19
unit + 4/4 end-to-end (jsdom) + 5/5 API assertions.
