+    <p class="hero-desc">The Decision Performance Index measures six dimensions of how your organisation makes decisions — quality, velocity, accountability, capability, value, and resilience. It does not measure AI maturity. It identifies the single dimension most limiting your ability to make high-value decisions, consistently and at pace. Rate your level of agreement with 18 statements.</p>
